      "message": "Thanks for your analysis. However, I think the reason that this works is that `MapAsyncImpl()` does not increment the serial on this path, so it does not require a `eglClientWaitSync()`. It is specific to the `MapAsync()` / `WaitAny()` call pattern used by Graphite, though. If any other calls were made between those two that incremented the serial (e.g., GL calls), it would likely fail.\n\nI\u0027ll update the description to reflect this more narrow functionality.",
